# Generated files (auto-created by probe.py / run.bat)
# _runtime.bat is TRACKED (seeded from probe.py output) so that fresh
# clones can run.bat without first manually running probe.py.
# probe.py overwrites it on every successful probe; this seed is the
# fallback when no probe has run yet. See v2.3.4 commit message.
opencode.json
agent-memory/CONTEXT.md
agent-memory/state.json
agent-memory/alerts.log
agent-memory/sessions/*.md

# Binaries bundled in package (NOT user-provided anymore)
# bin/      - extracted OpenCode (auto-created by setup.bat)
# tools/    - bundled llama-server.exe + DLLs (tracked)
# downloads/ - bundled opencode-windows-x64.zip (tracked)

# User-provided GGUF models (NOT bundled, must be added manually)
ollama-models/*.gguf
# But keep README + .gitkeep tracked
!ollama-models/README.md
!ollama-models/.gitkeep

# Python cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Temp
*.tmp
nul
